{
  "_comment": "Canonical structure of the CXOne WFM Customer Integration Guide, reverse-engineered from 'Customer Integration Guide Template v1.0'. 'need' = mandatory (missing -> Major) | expected (missing -> Minor) | conditional (only if applicable; never penalize). Section placement across chapters is flexible (see rubric). 'match' entries are case-insensitive substrings; any one matching a heading satisfies the section.",
  "cover_fields": ["Release", "Document Revision", "Distribution Status", "Publication Date"],
  "sections": [
    {"key": "introduction",        "chapter": 1, "need": "mandatory", "match": ["Introduction"]},
    {"key": "revision_history",    "chapter": 1, "need": "mandatory", "match": ["Document Revision History"], "expects": "table"},
